1
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:35,020
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,259 --> 00:01:37,690
[Episode 25]

3
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:40,520
Gently, gently.

4
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,850
It really hurts that much?

5
00:01:42,850 --> 00:01:44,110
Help me with this side.

6
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:47,870
Where does it hurt? Seems serious.

7
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,229
T-Touch it.

8
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,710
You perv.

9
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:59,310
Where is the refrigerator?

10
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:00,950
I'll get you some ice for the injury.

11
00:02:00,950 --> 00:02:01,610
Over there.

12
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:10,919
I'm not a perv.

13
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,710
I plan to formally submit a report

14
00:02:35,710 --> 00:02:36,360
to the court

15
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,620
and apply for a review.

16
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,520
I'm done with the underground work.

17
00:02:41,210 --> 00:02:42,079
My job is supposed to be

18
00:02:42,079 --> 00:02:43,280
open and aboveboard.

19
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,120
The court will be happy, won't they?

20
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:49,560
They will understand sooner or later.

21
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,520
I'm also afraid of progressing too slowly

22
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,579
to keep up with you.

23
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,500
Jianmin...

24
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,030
Recently,

25
00:03:02,830 --> 00:03:04,690
I've been thinking how lucky I am.

26
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,310
God has been so good to me,

27
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,680
as if He is making up for me.

28
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:15,320
Everything's so great that it actually

29
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,400
scares me

30
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:18,340
and panics me a little.

31
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:24,530
Don't fret.

32
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,760
All these good things

33
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,950
are what you deserve.

34
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:36,430
I...

35
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:39,270
plan to check out from the hotel.

36
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:41,680
I'm moving in here with you.

37
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,030
Really?

38
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,000
Really.

39
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:52,880
Why?

40
00:03:52,910 --> 00:03:54,200
Are you worried
it'll reflect badly on you?

41
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,480
No, I'm not. I-I...

42
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,760
I'm not.

43
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,890
My worry is that it might reflect badly
on you.

44
00:04:05,910 --> 00:04:06,970
Actually, I'd really...

45
00:04:06,970 --> 00:04:08,170
like to have a family.

46
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,440
H-How about we get a marriage

47
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,970
certificate first?

48
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,680
Okay.

49
00:04:23,450 --> 00:04:24,750
Let's get that first.

50
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:29,960
For real?

51
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,090
What's with you?

52
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:39,600
I...

53
00:04:39,620 --> 00:04:40,790
Once you hold my hand,

54
00:04:40,790 --> 00:04:42,110
you cannot let go of it.

55
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,600
I won't.

56
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:47,280
I'll hold it tight for life.

57
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,610
I'll never let go till my life ends.

58
00:04:55,750 --> 00:04:57,040
How am I s-so...

59
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,920
How am I so blessed?

60
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:02,510
Then why are you crying, lucky man?

61
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:03,570
Because I'm happy.

62
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,870
Aren't you silly?

63
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,870
No, the wound hurts.

64
00:05:15,850 --> 00:05:17,160
Easy on the food.

65
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,680
You must be starving.

66
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,590
But still, slow down.

67
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,460
Easy, easy.

68
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,610
Wipe your mouth.

69
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,360
Not full, are you?

70
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,460
I'll get you another portion.

71
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,000
No need.

72
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,950
Just stay with me for a while.

73
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,550
But you'll get hungry at night again.

74
00:05:35,550 --> 00:05:36,310
Just stay with me...

75
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,190
Let me save you the trouble.

76
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,190
Take my food here.

77
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,720
Just fetched it. Haven't touched it yet.

78
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,890
That would be inappropriate, Zhang.

79
00:05:40,890 --> 00:05:42,240
Keep it, ma'am. I'll go buy her some.

80
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:42,970
Just take it.

81
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:44,360
You two keep chatting.

82
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,690
I'm going out for a walk.

83
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:47,870
Thanks, Zhang.

84
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:48,930
No problem.

85
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,210
Shall I bring it over to you?

86
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:02,000
No need. I'll have it later.

87
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,680
When are you leaving?

88
00:06:17,130 --> 00:06:18,160
Why start with that question

89
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,560
every time I come see you?

90
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,830
Don't get me wrong.

91
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:21,920
I just don't want to keep you

92
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,510
from any important affairs.

93
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,360
You won't.

94
00:06:24,950 --> 00:06:25,750
Before I came,

95
00:06:26,060 --> 00:06:26,890
I prepared

96
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,250
everything necessary.

97
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,120
And there's a fax machine here.

98
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,180
I won't miss a beat.

99
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,510
Then how long can you stay?

100
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:38,360
How long do you hope I will stay?

101
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,610
Anything wrong?

102
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,870
Hu Xudong's case

103
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,040
is going to trial.

104
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:00,270
I'm a little worried.

105
00:07:00,510 --> 00:07:01,360
About what?

106
00:07:03,490 --> 00:07:04,160
About Hu Xudong

107
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:06,290
turning into another Qian Xingliang.

108
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,960
You're overthinking it.

109
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:18,200
Besides, it's no use worrying about that,

110
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:20,510
since it has nothing to do with you.

111
00:07:20,510 --> 00:07:21,360
It does.

112
00:07:23,620 --> 00:07:25,950
I know you're kindly trying to comfort me.

113
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:27,770
But I won't and I cannot

114
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,570
claim that this case

115
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,730
doesn't concern me.

116
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,120
I get it.

117
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,610
Go back already.

118
00:07:44,090 --> 00:07:45,330
I'll stay here tonight.

119
00:07:45,330 --> 00:07:46,159
When she's discharged tomorrow,

120
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:47,290
you come pick her up.

121
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,120
I owe you thanks for letting me know
her condition.

122
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,650
N-No need for thanks at all.

123
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:58,170
I just wish things will work out
between you two.

124
00:07:58,450 --> 00:07:59,720
You see, she's not being

125
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:01,050
well taken care of here.

126
00:08:01,370 --> 00:08:02,040
The procuratorate

127
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,310
also owes her

128
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,610
due to Qian Xingliang's matter.

129
00:08:05,610 --> 00:08:06,160
After she recovers,

130
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,890
please put in a good word for me.

131
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:10,120
I heard legal proceedings

132
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:12,040
have been initiated for that case.

133
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,720
Who told you that?

134
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,580
Was it Yingjie?

135
00:08:14,210 --> 00:08:15,240
Isn't it the reason

136
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,300
she came back here?

137
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:18,920
The news hasn't reached me yet.

138
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:21,750
Enough said about me.

139
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,810
Let's talk about you. How are things?

140
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:26,560
The new Criminal Procedure Law
will be enacted soon.

141
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,960
Haven't you been involved in the revision?

142
00:08:29,270 --> 00:08:29,950
Do offer us

143
00:08:29,950 --> 00:08:31,210
more guidance on work.

144
00:08:32,650 --> 00:08:33,620
We can discuss

145
00:08:33,650 --> 00:08:35,380
professional issues anytime.

146
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,960
I've read through the papers you wrote

147
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:40,820
in these years.

148
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:43,030
They are of great reference value.

149
00:08:43,030 --> 00:08:44,360
You wouldn't have been able

150
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,400
to write them so well

151
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,240
without abundant practical experience.

152
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,840
My papers are nothing.

153
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,550
You are truly armed with a doctorate.

154
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,260
You are the one who can really influence

155
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:55,320
the development of the national law.

156
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,090
Beijing is full of talents,

157
00:08:57,090 --> 00:08:58,000
unlike here.

158
00:08:58,550 --> 00:08:59,240
It's nearly impossible

159
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,370
to find a criminal defense lawyer here

160
00:09:01,390 --> 00:09:02,200
with relevant proficiency.

161
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,130
Hu Xudong's case

162
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,270
is an example.

163
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:06,510
Hu Xudong

164
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:07,440
hasn't found a lawyer yet?

165
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,390
Doubtlessly,

166
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,360
he'll surely be assigned a court-appointed

167
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,580
legal aid lawyer.

168
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:15,090
Remember? "A first-time offender
of a casual nature."

169
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,170
Enough said. Off you go.

170
00:09:20,050 --> 00:09:20,720
Yu.

171
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,510
I'm wondering...

172
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:33,640
I plan to come back to Binjiang.

173
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:35,720
Why come back to Binjiang?

174
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,790
What for?

175
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,740
Just for the sake of Binjiang.

176
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:41,790
Didn't you say

177
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:42,510
there isn't even

178
00:09:42,510 --> 00:09:44,710
a decent criminal defense lawyer here?

179
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,270
If I were you,
I definitely wouldn't come back.

180
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,670
It's too big a sacrifice.

181
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,180
I don't think of it as a sacrifice.

182
00:09:52,970 --> 00:09:54,320
Do you think I'm not qualified?

183
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:54,840
You are.

184
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,000
I raise both hands for it.

185
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,630
Your return will bring a balance

186
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:02,960
between the prosecution and the defense.

187
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:05,250
Let me walk you out, buddy.

188
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:10,070
-Are you sure?
-Sure.

189
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:16,550
You won't drink breast milk

190
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:17,720
or formula!

191
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,390
What on earth do you want?

192
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:22,750
Stop crying!

193
00:10:22,770 --> 00:10:24,340
I'm begging you.

194
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:27,030
I'm begging you!

195
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:32,640
Xiaowen.

196
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:33,750
Xiaowen.

197
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:37,440
Your mom sent me over

198
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,000
to visit you and Peipei.

199
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:43,090
J-Just consider me

200
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,510
a delivery person.

201
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:45,440
Look.

202
00:10:46,250 --> 00:10:48,000
This is imported baby formula.

203
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:48,720
I...

204
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,630
I had it brought back from Hong Kong

205
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,290
by someone.

206
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,840
It costs several hundred yuan a can.

207
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,320
I have to work on two cases to afford...

208
00:10:59,150 --> 00:10:59,720
Xiaowen.

209
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:03,500
P-Please let me

210
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,080
see my grandson.

211
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:11,390
Xiaowen.

212
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,150
Xiaowen!

213
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,670
I just want to remind you

214
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,610
to take your time with the baby.

215
00:11:19,150 --> 00:11:20,610
Be patient.

216
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:24,000
Patience is a must.

217
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,790
I'll leave the formula

218
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:28,750
on the cabinet by the door.

219
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,420
I'm taking off now.

220
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:32,400
Remember...

221
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:34,670
to bring it home quickly.

222
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,420
Or it'll go missing again.

223
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:20,360
Who are you looking for?

224
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,020
Hand it out!

225
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,550
Hand out what?

226
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:24,440
You also took the items last time,

227
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,100
didn't you?

228
00:12:25,940 --> 00:12:27,860
What do you mean by that?

229
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,240
You must be delutional.

230
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:31,390
Listen up,

231
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
I'm a lawyer.

232
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:35,200
And I'm a chef!

233
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,060
You think you can scare me?

234
00:12:38,530 --> 00:12:40,440
That imported baby formula and 3,000 yuan

235
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,690
are my gifts for my daughter.

236
00:12:41,690 --> 00:12:43,120
What do I have to do with the gifts

237
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,150
you got your daughter?

238
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:46,150
Now you are a repeat offender.

239
00:12:47,210 --> 00:12:49,210
According to Article 151

240
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,510
and 152 of the Criminal Law,

241
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:51,630
and the Notice on Adjusting

242
00:12:51,630 --> 00:12:53,020
the Threshold Amounts for Theft

243
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:56,790
Offenses issued by the Supreme Court
and the Supreme Procuratorate,

244
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:59,390
your actions constitute a theft case
involving a large sum of money.

245
00:12:59,390 --> 00:12:59,720
I...

246
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,120
Notice? What notice?

247
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:06,080
And now I can also sue you for assault!

248
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,510
To hell with that!

249
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:08,390
Scram!

250
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:23,180
It doesn't hurt.

251
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,860
I deserve this.

252
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,640
Slow down. Be gentle!

253
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,120
I already told you

254
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:33,960
you were mistaken.

255
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,760
I didn't do it.

256
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,240
It wasn't me!

257
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:37,320
How was I supposed to know he'd collapse

258
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,520
after just one punch?

259
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:39,470
Don't push me!

260
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:41,150
Gentler, the two of you!

261
00:13:41,610 --> 00:13:43,490
I know! Just don't push!

262
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,320
Pei!

263
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:46,550
Don't cry, Peipei.

264
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:47,680
Everything's fine.

265
00:13:48,230 --> 00:13:49,910
Grandpa is just going to make a statement.

266
00:13:49,910 --> 00:13:50,910
Then I'll be home.

267
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:52,270
My dear daughter,

268
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,790
I'm so delighted today.

269
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:57,460
Thank you for bandaging my wound.

270
00:13:58,550 --> 00:13:59,150
Today's

271
00:13:59,650 --> 00:14:01,240
beating was worth it.

272
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:02,600
I even want to

273
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,540
thank that couple.

274
00:14:07,790 --> 00:14:08,670
I'm leaving then.

275
00:14:08,670 --> 00:14:10,270
Goodbye, Pei! See you later!

276
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:24,160
This place is absolutely ridiculous.

277
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:25,960
The car I booked earlier

278
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,220
suddenly bailed on me,

279
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,320
so I had to take a long-distance bus.

280
00:14:31,150 --> 00:14:32,080
Cancel the trip?

281
00:14:32,270 --> 00:14:33,670
How can I cancel the trip?

282
00:14:33,750 --> 00:14:34,750
That scam company

283
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:36,270
swindled over two million out of me.

284
00:14:36,270 --> 00:14:37,670
How can I let them get away?

285
00:14:37,670 --> 00:14:39,000
Yes, in Nanyu, exactly.

286
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:40,510
Nanyu is a hell

287
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,030
of a place.

288
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,030
How do I find them?

289
00:14:45,630 --> 00:14:47,390
I don't know a single soul there.

290
00:14:47,390 --> 00:14:48,440
In a small town like this,

291
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,200
I doubt if there's even a lawyer.

292
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,030
Anyway, the first thing I'll do
when I arrive

293
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:52,760
is try my luck

294
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,200
at the police station

295
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,240
and then the courthouse.

296
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,850
I'm hanging off now.

297
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,670
I'll call you back later.

298
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:01,200
Bye.

299
00:15:28,510 --> 00:15:29,440
What do you want?

300
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,320
Did you just say

301
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,720
you need a lawyer in Nanyu

302
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:34,030
for a financial dispute?

303
00:15:34,390 --> 00:15:35,920
You understand Cantonese?

304
00:15:36,150 --> 00:15:37,950
My grandfather is from Conghua.

305
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,070
Who are you?

306
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:42,240
I am a lawyer.

307
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:44,240
The best lawyer in Nanyu.

308
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,200
My name is Qin Zhigao.

309
00:15:52,530 --> 00:15:55,100
[Nanyu Jianzheng Law Firm,
Lawyer Qin Zhigao]

310
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,690
Hello. Anyone in there?

311
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,030
Coming!

312
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:25,750
Hello.

313
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:28,030
Who are you looking for?

314
00:16:28,030 --> 00:16:28,630
This is

315
00:16:29,150 --> 00:16:30,120
Wang Danni's home, right?

316
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:30,940
Yes.

317
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:32,640
Hello.

318
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,000
I'm Lyu Siyi's father.

319
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:35,790
I'd like a word with Wang Danni

320
00:16:35,790 --> 00:16:36,670
about the case.

321
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:39,480
Please wait a moment.

322
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:51,600
How dare you come here,

323
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,480
you murderer!

324
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:53,980
This serves you right!

325
00:17:07,510 --> 00:17:08,480
Murder!

326
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,640
There's a murder!

327
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,010
How about you wait outside

328
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,420
while I go in by myself?

329
00:17:18,310 --> 00:17:18,880
Okay.

330
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:19,880
Otherwise,

331
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,240
we might come across as too eager.

332
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:21,640
Right.

333
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,160
We're simply paying a visit.

334
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,359
I'm afraid he might misinterpret this.

335
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,609
I'm off then.

336
00:17:27,569 --> 00:17:29,160
I'll be waiting here for you!

337
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,420
Take a seat somewhere.

338
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:40,930
Captain Lyu.

339
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:03,080
Captain Lyu.

340
00:18:18,550 --> 00:18:19,550
How are your ribs?

341
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,370
Are you okay?

342
00:18:20,870 --> 00:18:21,310
I'm fine.

343
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:22,710
All I need is a bit of rest.

344
00:18:23,790 --> 00:18:24,920
Sorry, Captain Lyu.

345
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,820
I failed to catch him that day.

346
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:29,970
Don't say that.

347
00:18:31,070 --> 00:18:32,400
I'm the one who owes you.

348
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,810
You came all the way here

349
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:41,310
to ask about that matter, right?

350
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:43,910
There is indeed a matter.

351
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:46,590
Those silly boys of yours had me ask you

352
00:18:46,590 --> 00:18:48,050
when the arcade will open.

353
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:52,830
Captain Lyu, take care of your daughter.

354
00:18:52,830 --> 00:18:53,890
I'm getting going.

355
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:56,530
Alright, no need to beat around the bush.

356
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,900
You see what condition

357
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,240
my daughter is in.

358
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:05,880
Now, I can

359
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,010
tell you explicitly

360
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,070
that I'm in no mood

361
00:19:08,070 --> 00:19:08,700
to help with

362
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:10,160
Yan Jicai's case anymore.

363
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:14,510
That said, to this day, I still believe

364
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:15,750
Yan Jicai cannot be ruled out

365
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:16,880
as a murder suspect.

366
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,400
So he's a suspect now,

367
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:22,530
not a murderer anymore?

368
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:25,060
Don't play word games with me.

369
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:27,200
Got it.

370
00:19:29,030 --> 00:19:30,230
I'll see you sometime

371
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:31,580
later then.

372
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:38,840
Thank you.

373
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,270
Also, please say thank you

374
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:42,800
to Prosecutor Zhang for me.

375
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,090
I really mean it.

376
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:47,480
Okay.

377
00:20:05,590 --> 00:20:06,320
How did it go?

378
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:08,080
Did he bring that thing up?

379
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:09,510
He mentioned it himself

380
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:11,110
and said he had no time for it.

381
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:12,930
It's okay.

382
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:15,510
Let's go talk to Zhou Pu and Qiao Xiaojun.

383
00:20:15,510 --> 00:20:15,920
Sure.

384
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:20,960
What's wrong?

385
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,690
The postman. I missed the postman.

386
00:20:22,690 --> 00:20:23,520
What postman?

387
00:20:23,550 --> 00:20:24,680
Why would you wait for him?

388
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:26,210
For the registered letter.

389
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:28,240
What's with it?

390
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:29,340
Didn't you ask Mr. Guo

391
00:20:29,340 --> 00:20:31,540
to send over the household register
and a letter of introduction?

392
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:33,940
How else can we get
a marriage certificate?

393
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,700
What's wrong with you?

394
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:38,590
I thought I missed

395
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,720
out on some details.

396
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:41,370
You gave me a fright.

397
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,860
What? Do you regret it now?

398
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:43,830
No!

399
00:20:52,190 --> 00:20:57,910
[Binjiang People's Procuratorate]

400
00:21:01,270 --> 00:21:01,830
Yizhong.

401
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:03,240
Mentor.

402
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:05,720
You like

403
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,790
peaches, right?

404
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:07,400
They are in season,

405
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,600
so I brought you some.

406
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:09,960
Great. Thank you.

407
00:21:10,510 --> 00:21:11,040
Sit down.

408
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:12,960
Have you decided?

409
00:21:13,830 --> 00:21:14,350
Yes.

410
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:15,680
Now, I just need to

411
00:21:15,680 --> 00:21:16,880
persuade my teacher and my dad

412
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:17,740
when I get home.

413
00:21:18,270 --> 00:21:19,270
It's not a bad idea.

414
00:21:19,270 --> 00:21:22,120
For you, returning to Binjiang
is like reclaiming lost land.

415
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:23,090
How is that so?

416
00:21:23,750 --> 00:21:25,440
In terms of reclaiming lost land,

417
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:27,720
I'd rather start with our courthouse.

418
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:30,960
What do you mean?

419
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:33,000
I plan to be

420
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,760
Hu Xudong's defense lawyer.

421
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,540
He hasn't found a lawyer yet, has he?

422
00:21:37,540 --> 00:21:39,740
The case files are still being studied.

423
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:42,350
How did you know I'd be handling his case?

424
00:21:42,350 --> 00:21:43,270
No, I didn't.

425
00:21:44,650 --> 00:21:46,050
So you'll be handling it?

426
00:21:46,370 --> 00:21:48,370
I didn't know that until you told me.

427
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:52,830
Mentor,

428
00:21:53,460 --> 00:21:54,070
we all know

429
00:21:54,070 --> 00:21:56,200
lawyers face three major difficulties

430
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,460
when working on cases—

431
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:58,640
meeting clients,

432
00:21:58,880 --> 00:21:59,880
reviewing files,

433
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:02,160
and investigating
and collecting evidence.

434
00:22:02,160 --> 00:22:03,160
I'll try to figure

435
00:22:03,590 --> 00:22:05,310
something out for the third problem.

436
00:22:05,310 --> 00:22:06,880
But you can solve

437
00:22:07,750 --> 00:22:09,280
the first two for me, right?

438
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,720
When will you go back to Beijing?

439
00:22:20,740 --> 00:22:24,480
[Binjiang Station]

440
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,420
The local police station,

441
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:24,070
in collaboration with the railway police,

442
00:22:24,070 --> 00:22:25,790
is strengthening patrols within

443
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:26,770
to sternly crack down on

444
00:22:26,770 --> 00:22:29,270
theft, pickpocketing, and affray
in the station.

445
00:22:29,270 --> 00:22:30,770
Once I settle everything down,

446
00:22:30,770 --> 00:22:31,630
I'll come back.

447
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:32,680
If anything comes up,

448
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:33,610
call me anytime.

449
00:22:34,690 --> 00:22:35,350
When you get home,

450
00:22:35,350 --> 00:22:37,610
talk properly with your dad and Mr. Zhou.

451
00:22:38,550 --> 00:22:40,830
Or maybe just tell them I pressured you
into this.

452
00:22:40,830 --> 00:22:41,480
No need.

453
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:43,510
I know what to say to them.

454
00:22:43,510 --> 00:22:44,240
Don't worry.

455
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:45,920
They'll be supportive.

456
00:22:48,350 --> 00:22:48,880
Yizhong,

457
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:51,280
if you change your mind

458
00:22:51,310 --> 00:22:52,310
when you get home,

459
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,640
just give me a call.

460
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,040
No need for any explanation.

461
00:22:56,350 --> 00:22:57,350
I'll understand.

462
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,840
And I won't blame you.

463
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:00,440
My mind's set.

464
00:23:00,940 --> 00:23:01,880
My mentor said, for me,

465
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:02,740
returning here

466
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:04,970
is like reclaiming lost land.

467
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:07,120
I'm back here for you,

468
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:08,640
but not entirely for you.

469
00:23:11,590 --> 00:23:12,990
I've thought it through.

470
00:23:13,110 --> 00:23:14,570
I just want to be back here.

471
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:17,110
Okay.

472
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:21,240
I'm taking off then.

473
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,570
Wait for me to come back.

474
00:23:32,830 --> 00:23:33,750
I'll wait for you.

475
00:23:33,750 --> 00:23:34,350
Please do.

476
00:23:39,350 --> 00:23:39,960
Yizhong,

477
00:23:40,210 --> 00:23:41,750
be careful and stay safe!

478
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:01,690
Captain Lyu,

479
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:04,030
what about that pager message?

480
00:24:04,030 --> 00:24:05,550
What's your opinion on it?

481
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:08,770
What pager message?

482
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:09,860
You don't know?

483
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:12,450
At 11:31,

484
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:14,200
Yan Jicai sent a pager message

485
00:24:14,350 --> 00:24:15,400
to his wife.

486
00:24:19,110 --> 00:24:20,570
I really didn't know that.

487
00:24:21,350 --> 00:24:22,480
Surveillance shows

488
00:24:22,530 --> 00:24:23,160
that Yan Jicai's car

489
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,130
entered Gaoxin Road

490
00:24:24,130 --> 00:24:25,150
at 11:15,

491
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:26,640
and then left at 11:57.

492
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:28,240
His car stayed on Gaoxin Road

493
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,640
for a total of 42 minutes.

494
00:24:30,040 --> 00:24:30,720
From the parking spot

495
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:31,660
you identified

496
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,990
to the nearest public phone booth,

497
00:24:32,990 --> 00:24:34,110
I studied the site myself and found

498
00:24:34,110 --> 00:24:35,400
it is at least a six-minute trip.

499
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,880
Plus the time used to page his wife,

500
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,920
the whole thing would consume 13 minutes.

501
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,510
It took 2 minutes for Yan Jicai's car

502
00:24:40,510 --> 00:24:41,640
to get on Gaoxin Road

503
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,500
and reach that parking spot,

504
00:24:42,500 --> 00:24:43,850
which means he paused there

505
00:24:43,850 --> 00:24:44,400
at 11:17.

506
00:24:44,650 --> 00:24:45,440
Then he stayed

507
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,640
in the car for 8 minutes.

508
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:48,440
At 11:25, he got off the car
to find a phone

509
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,840
to send that pager message.

510
00:24:49,840 --> 00:24:50,680
Thirteen minutes later,

511
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,200
namely

512
00:24:51,220 --> 00:24:52,490
after 11:38, he got back

513
00:24:52,490 --> 00:24:53,250
into the car.

514
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:55,290
Then it took 3 minutes for his car

515
00:24:55,290 --> 00:24:56,160
to go from the parking spot

516
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,340
to the exit of Gaoxin Road.

517
00:24:57,340 --> 00:24:57,830
That means

518
00:24:57,830 --> 00:24:59,760
he started driving again at 11:54.

519
00:24:59,790 --> 00:25:01,880
So, from the time he got back into the car

520
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,030
till he began driving again,

521
00:25:03,030 --> 00:25:05,360
he only spent 17 minutes
in the car at most.

522
00:25:08,730 --> 00:25:11,260
[Caiji Noodle House]

523
00:25:09,790 --> 00:25:11,390
Boss, the pay's on the table.

524
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,650
Okay, take care!

525
00:25:14,830 --> 00:25:15,310
Mom.

526
00:25:16,270 --> 00:25:16,680
Mom!

527
00:25:16,830 --> 00:25:17,430
What is it?

528
00:25:17,780 --> 00:25:18,790
Go collect the money

529
00:25:18,790 --> 00:25:19,260
on that table.

530
00:25:19,260 --> 00:25:19,990
I'm busy now.

531
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:22,550
Mom.

532
00:25:23,070 --> 00:25:23,680
Look,

533
00:25:24,110 --> 00:25:25,370
that man's here again.

534
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:38,960
Ignore him. Go do your homework.

535
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,240
Eat up.

536
00:25:45,510 --> 00:25:46,440
It's not poisoned.

537
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:46,830
Okay.

538
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:48,290
Nor did we spit in it.

539
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:52,880
The chili provided here is spicy.

540
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:53,480
Easy on it.

541
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:54,600
Liu Guiya.

542
00:25:56,210 --> 00:25:56,960
I heard you're

543
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,420
still keeping that pager.

544
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:04,080
It was this pager message

545
00:26:04,170 --> 00:26:04,920
that divided the period

546
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:06,590
of him being on Gaoxin Road
into two parts.

547
00:26:06,590 --> 00:26:07,650
One was 8 minutes,

548
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:09,000
and the other 17 minutes.

549
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:10,550
Let's say he made the best
of those 17 minutes.

550
00:26:10,550 --> 00:26:11,110
Do you think

551
00:26:11,110 --> 00:26:12,410
he could commit that heinous crime

552
00:26:12,410 --> 00:26:13,610
on the victim

553
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,040
within such a short time?

554
00:26:15,270 --> 00:26:16,470
Could it be possible?

555
00:26:18,030 --> 00:26:18,830
Anyone there?

556
00:26:19,310 --> 00:26:20,440
Is anyone out there?

557
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:33,770
You've been keeping it

558
00:26:34,030 --> 00:26:35,230
over all these years?

559
00:26:35,790 --> 00:26:36,850
Of course I have to.

560
00:26:37,750 --> 00:26:39,920
I'll keep it till you people regain
your conscience

561
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:41,250
and come to your senses.

562
00:26:43,870 --> 00:26:45,280
[There are guests]

563
00:26:47,920 --> 00:26:49,590
Have you shown it to our people?

564
00:26:49,590 --> 00:26:50,110
Yes.

565
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:51,640
Who?

566
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:53,610
What's the name?

567
00:26:53,790 --> 00:26:54,640
How did he look?

568
00:26:54,640 --> 00:26:55,510
He didn't tell me his name.

569
00:26:55,510 --> 00:26:57,570
Otherwise, I would've memorized it.

570
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,540
It was a young police officer,

571
00:26:59,750 --> 00:27:01,280
with a mole on his right ear.

572
00:27:03,690 --> 00:27:04,720
Can I borrow it?

573
00:27:04,790 --> 00:27:05,270
No.

574
00:27:06,110 --> 00:27:07,480
Lending it to me will do good

575
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:08,600
to you and your husband.

576
00:27:08,600 --> 00:27:09,930
You think I'd trust you?

577
00:27:14,750 --> 00:27:15,400
Liu Guiya,

578
00:27:16,750 --> 00:27:18,160
do you really believe

579
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:20,380
your husband didn't do it?

580
00:27:29,750 --> 00:27:31,080
Under this piece of land

581
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,300
lives a pig demon.

582
00:27:33,890 --> 00:27:35,070
It eats our garbage every day

583
00:27:35,070 --> 00:27:37,000
as it cultivates for immortality.

584
00:27:37,310 --> 00:27:39,840
It can even recite
the multiplication table.

585
00:27:40,510 --> 00:27:41,640
Do you believe that?

586
00:27:45,320 --> 00:27:46,650
I'd rather believe this

587
00:27:47,450 --> 00:27:48,440
than believe my husband

588
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:49,240
is a beast.

589
00:27:54,410 --> 00:27:57,520
[Nanlu Public Security Bureau]

590
00:28:08,590 --> 00:28:09,320
Captain Lyu,

591
00:28:09,350 --> 00:28:10,750
got some free time today?

592
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:12,280
Where is Wang?

593
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:13,400
Section Chief Wang?

594
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:14,660
Maybe in the restroom.

595
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:17,730
Captain Lyu?

596
00:28:18,350 --> 00:28:19,010
Free today?

597
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:20,510
Quick.

598
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:21,510
Take a seat.

599
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:23,100
What's up, Captain Lyu?

600
00:28:23,100 --> 00:28:24,070
I'd like a word with Wang.

601
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:25,640
Please step out for a moment.

602
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:26,000
Okay.

603
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:32,510
Wang.

604
00:28:33,750 --> 00:28:34,610
Do you remember

605
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:36,030
Yan Jicai's case

606
00:28:36,030 --> 00:28:36,890
from years ago?

607
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:39,720
Well,

608
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:41,720
it was too long ago.

609
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:45,680
You went to his home

610
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:47,970
and saw

611
00:28:48,550 --> 00:28:49,220
a pager message

612
00:28:49,220 --> 00:28:50,480
his wife had received.

613
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:51,650
Did that happen?

614
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:58,840
I went several times.

615
00:29:00,250 --> 00:29:01,410
But I was with

616
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:03,110
different co-workers on each trip,

617
00:29:03,110 --> 00:29:04,070
including Li, Zhang,

618
00:29:04,070 --> 00:29:05,350
and Wu.

619
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:06,140
All of them.

620
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,040
His wife only remembers you.

621
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:11,000
Is that so?

622
00:29:12,120 --> 00:29:13,440
Then why wasn't it reflected

623
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:15,170
in the interrogation records?

624
00:29:15,890 --> 00:29:16,720
When we discussed the case,

625
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:18,450
you never mentioned it either.

626
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:20,610
Captain Lyu,

627
00:29:21,120 --> 00:29:22,310
you cannot blame this

628
00:29:22,310 --> 00:29:23,200
on me.

629
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,090
What do you mean?

630
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:26,290
Have you forgotten?

631
00:29:26,830 --> 00:29:29,290
At that time, who was
the first one to suggest

632
00:29:29,310 --> 00:29:30,240
Yan Jicai

633
00:29:31,070 --> 00:29:32,550
was the prime suspect?

634
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,070
It was you.

635
00:29:34,590 --> 00:29:36,030
You kept urging us

636
00:29:36,310 --> 00:29:38,550
to collect all evidence of his guilt.

637
00:29:39,050 --> 00:29:40,400
So, by interviewing his wife,

638
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,640
I was completely following

639
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:43,440
your instructions at that time.

640
00:29:46,270 --> 00:29:47,070
Are you saying

641
00:29:47,590 --> 00:29:48,480
that you knew

642
00:29:48,920 --> 00:29:49,850
this could be

643
00:29:49,880 --> 00:29:51,440
exculpatory evidence

644
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:52,520
for Yan Jicai？

645
00:29:53,800 --> 00:29:55,480
You didn't instruct us to collect

646
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:57,610
the evidence of his innocence as well.

647
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,880
You are also a police officer yourself.

648
00:30:01,030 --> 00:30:02,650
When it comes to a criminal suspect,

649
00:30:02,650 --> 00:30:03,350
we're supposed to collect evidence

650
00:30:03,350 --> 00:30:04,180
of guilt,

651
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:05,350
as well as evidence

652
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:06,960
of mitigating circumstances or innocence.

653
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:08,090
Don't you know that?

654
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:10,130
Captain Lyu,

655
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:11,200
calm down.

656
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,250
Everyone respects you,

657
00:30:13,590 --> 00:30:14,520
out of kindness.

658
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:17,160
But it's important for one
to know one's place.

659
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:18,590
You've already retired.

660
00:30:19,030 --> 00:30:20,920
There's no need to dig up the past.

661
00:30:22,350 --> 00:30:23,590
By clinging to an old case,

662
00:30:23,590 --> 00:30:24,790
you'll only end up

663
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:27,220
hurting yourself. What's the point?

664
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,000
I've read the material

665
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:35,860
you submitted.

666
00:30:35,900 --> 00:30:37,690
[Request to Initiate a Case Review]

667
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:38,050
Is it a case of yours?

668
00:30:38,110 --> 00:30:38,640
No.

669
00:30:39,080 --> 00:30:40,040
Then why did you

670
00:30:40,070 --> 00:30:41,330
submit this material?

671
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:42,830
Why ask us to initiate

672
00:30:42,830 --> 00:30:43,830
a case review?

673
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,680
Prosecutor Fang,

674
00:30:45,830 --> 00:30:46,960
this case was brought up

675
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,660
by Bieshan Prison, where Yan Jicai

676
00:30:48,660 --> 00:30:49,590
is serving time.

677
00:30:49,760 --> 00:30:50,790
They think there are many doubts

678
00:30:50,790 --> 00:30:51,720
about this case.

679
00:30:52,040 --> 00:30:52,960
I took some time to look into it.

680
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:54,620
There are indeed some doubts.

681
00:30:54,700 --> 00:30:55,160
I thought

682
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:56,330
we must protect our reputation,

683
00:30:56,330 --> 00:30:57,690
since the case was handled
by our procuratorate.

684
00:30:57,690 --> 00:30:58,350
Therefore,

685
00:30:58,720 --> 00:30:59,850
I wrote this report.

686
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,590
You know who first dealt with

687
00:31:01,590 --> 00:31:02,590
this case, right?

688
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:04,720
You should've talked to them first.

689
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:06,560
I did, on several occasions.

690
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:08,930
But they didn't see any problems.

691
00:31:09,110 --> 00:31:09,970
How bold of you.

692
00:31:10,750 --> 00:31:12,480
I guess you're doing this on purpose.

693
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:13,480
No, I'm not.

694
00:31:13,590 --> 00:31:15,680
Aren't you worried about
offending others by handing in

695
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:17,610
a report directly to a supervisor?

696
00:31:17,980 --> 00:31:19,120
I think they'd understand.

697
00:31:19,120 --> 00:31:20,130
This is not exactly

698
00:31:20,130 --> 00:31:21,190
a personal grudge.

699
00:31:22,350 --> 00:31:23,080
To be honest,

700
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:27,040
I was in the Complaints
and Appeals Division at that time.

701
00:31:27,040 --> 00:31:28,240
After this case was submitted,

702
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,640
I also found the evidence

703
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:30,520
problematic.

704
00:31:32,510 --> 00:31:33,590
This case involves

705
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:35,240
too many departments

706
00:31:35,270 --> 00:31:36,070
and officers.

707
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:38,350
There's no way we can cooperate

708
00:31:38,500 --> 00:31:40,100
in initiating a case review.

709
00:31:41,030 --> 00:31:41,640
However,

710
00:31:42,510 --> 00:31:43,440
I, personally,

711
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:46,530
support you investigating it in private.

712
00:31:46,750 --> 00:31:48,030
If you find solid evidence,

713
00:31:48,030 --> 00:31:49,290
things will be easier.

714
00:31:49,310 --> 00:31:50,270
If not,

715
00:31:50,920 --> 00:31:52,250
there's still a way out.

716
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:55,000
How thoughtful of you, sir.

717
00:31:55,030 --> 00:31:55,720
I... got it.

718
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:58,410
What was said in this room today

719
00:31:59,070 --> 00:32:00,440
stays in this room.

720
00:32:00,790 --> 00:32:01,880
You can do that, right?

721
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,030
If you don't trust me,

722
00:32:03,030 --> 00:32:03,980
I'll just live in here then.

723
00:32:03,980 --> 00:32:04,920
No way. Cut it out.

724
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:05,900
I'll sleep right here on the floor.

725
00:32:05,900 --> 00:32:06,770
Not a chance.

726
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,090
Go away already.

727
00:32:08,830 --> 00:32:09,830
I'm leaving then.

728
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:15,690
Captain Lyu,

729
00:32:15,840 --> 00:32:16,650
what made you

730
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:17,810
want to look at this?

731
00:32:17,830 --> 00:32:19,750
We don't have
the investigation subsidiary file here.

732
00:32:19,750 --> 00:32:20,440
You know,

733
00:32:20,790 --> 00:32:22,120
we have rules to follow.

734
00:32:22,210 --> 00:32:22,920
Not just anyone

735
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:25,450
can access investigation subsidiary files.

736
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:27,310
Years ago, I was

737
00:32:27,310 --> 00:32:28,570
in charge of this case.

738
00:32:29,270 --> 00:32:31,690
Now the procuratorate
has raised an objection.

739
00:32:31,690 --> 00:32:32,470
Why can't I read

740
00:32:32,470 --> 00:32:34,530
the investigation subsidiary file?

741
00:32:36,070 --> 00:32:37,070
I'll ask about it.

742
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,480
Chief Jiang,

743
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:44,920
Captain Lyu is with me now.

744
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:46,050
There's a matter...

745
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:52,100
Chief Jiang would like to see you.

746
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:52,590
Okay.

747
00:32:55,860 --> 00:33:00,150
[Chief's Officer]

748
00:32:56,640 --> 00:32:57,310
Mentor!

749
00:32:59,010 --> 00:32:59,590
Why didn't you

750
00:32:59,590 --> 00:33:01,160
tell me about your visit to the bureau?

751
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:01,640
Come on.

752
00:33:03,350 --> 00:33:04,200
Take a seat.

753
00:33:08,270 --> 00:33:09,400
Look at you,

754
00:33:09,830 --> 00:33:11,240
still as grumpy as ever.

755
00:33:12,640 --> 00:33:13,970
Still in a bad mood, huh?

756
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:15,920
I heard...

757
00:33:16,630 --> 00:33:17,290
Siyi is able

758
00:33:17,310 --> 00:33:18,510
to eat by herself now.

759
00:33:19,350 --> 00:33:20,960
I'll bring my wife and kids to visit Siyi

760
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:21,690
in a few days.

761
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,530
Everything's fine.

762
00:33:24,670 --> 00:33:26,070
Did you just beat up Wang?

763
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,260
It doesn't matter.

764
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:31,450
I've hated him for a long time.

765
00:33:31,490 --> 00:33:32,150
He's incompetent

766
00:33:32,150 --> 00:33:33,350
and loves kissing up.

767
00:33:33,510 --> 00:33:35,400
Have some tea and calm down.

768
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,430
I only have one request.

769
00:33:38,430 --> 00:33:39,520
I'd like to read

770
00:33:39,550 --> 00:33:40,610
the investigation

771
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:42,350
subsidiary file of Yan Jicai's case.

772
00:33:42,350 --> 00:33:43,080
Is that okay?

773
00:33:44,350 --> 00:33:46,590
Those two prosecutors from Bieshan Prison

774
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,920
approached you, right?

775
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,860
This matter concerns no one else.

776
00:33:50,860 --> 00:33:51,870
Mentor...

777
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:55,190
Those two prosecutors
are really persistent.

778
00:33:55,510 --> 00:33:57,790
They've pulled strings
and written letters.

779
00:33:57,790 --> 00:34:00,050
And now, they're trying to convince you.

780
00:34:00,090 --> 00:34:00,640
I worked on

781
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:02,000
Yan's case with you.

782
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:04,480
Don't we know this case
better than anyone?

783
00:34:04,480 --> 00:34:06,280
This is a waste of time, isn't it?

784
00:34:07,590 --> 00:34:08,520
Do you know this?

785
00:34:09,850 --> 00:34:10,889
Yan Jicai's car

786
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:11,840
once stopped

787
00:34:12,120 --> 00:34:12,710
on Gaoxin Road.

788
00:34:12,710 --> 00:34:14,280
He got out, found a phone booth,

789
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:15,760
and paged his wife.

790
00:34:17,070 --> 00:34:17,920
I didn't know that.

791
00:34:17,920 --> 00:34:18,440
See?

792
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:20,719
I also learned about it just now.

793
00:34:20,850 --> 00:34:22,199
Where did you hear this?

794
00:34:22,230 --> 00:34:23,360
I saw with my own eyes

795
00:34:23,670 --> 00:34:25,469
the message on his wife's pager.

796
00:34:25,550 --> 00:34:27,480
The time displayed can't be wrong.

797
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:28,440
We can check the records

798
00:34:28,440 --> 00:34:29,449
at the paging station.

799
00:34:29,449 --> 00:34:30,320
This lead is of great

800
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,050
importance,

801
00:34:31,219 --> 00:34:32,150
yet that brat Wang Lin didn't

802
00:34:32,150 --> 00:34:34,480
put it down in the interrogation records.

803
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:36,880
Now, you know

804
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:38,210
why I beat him up, right?

805
00:34:45,510 --> 00:34:46,190
Mentor,

806
00:34:47,230 --> 00:34:48,960
what can a pager message prove?

807
00:34:49,670 --> 00:34:50,600
Do you remember?

808
00:34:51,150 --> 00:34:52,550
At that time, we already determined

809
00:34:52,550 --> 00:34:54,440
the car wasn't the primary crime scene.

810
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:56,770
It was the woods where the crime happened.

811
00:35:01,010 --> 00:35:01,800
Do you know why my daughter

812
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:03,060
jumped off a building?

813
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:08,280
Because she was falsely accused

814
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:09,630
and couldn't see any way out.

815
00:35:09,630 --> 00:35:10,800
Do you mean

816
00:35:11,760 --> 00:35:13,280
we wrongly accused Yan Jicai?

817
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:14,230
I didn't say that.

818
00:35:14,230 --> 00:35:15,630
But doesn't the omission

819
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:17,320
of such an important clue

820
00:35:17,330 --> 00:35:18,000
as the pager message

821
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,800
from the interrogation records

822
00:35:19,970 --> 00:35:20,970
mean that we made

823
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:21,890
a major oversight

824
00:35:21,890 --> 00:35:23,490
when we dealt with this case?

825
00:35:28,150 --> 00:35:28,960
Mentor,

826
00:35:32,150 --> 00:35:33,920
I understand your concern.

827
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:35,530
But do you remember?

828
00:35:36,120 --> 00:35:36,850
All of us were

829
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:37,900
under tremendous pressure

830
00:35:37,900 --> 00:35:39,360
when working on this case.

831
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:40,150
It was returned

832
00:35:40,150 --> 00:35:41,570
by the procuratorate and the court

833
00:35:41,570 --> 00:35:43,570
for investigations several times,

834
00:35:43,600 --> 00:35:44,460
causing rumors

835
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:46,000
everywhere in society.

836
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:47,730
People said we made a mistake.

837
00:35:47,930 --> 00:35:49,590
We withstood enormous pressure

838
00:35:49,590 --> 00:35:51,590
to finally bring Yan Jicai to court.

839
00:35:51,670 --> 00:35:52,870
Do you remember that?

840
00:35:53,000 --> 00:35:54,400
I've never forgotten it.

841
00:35:54,510 --> 00:35:55,890
I'm asking to read the investigation

842
00:35:55,890 --> 00:35:57,110
subsidiary file exactly because I am

843
00:35:57,110 --> 00:35:58,170
having doubts now.

844
00:35:58,960 --> 00:36:00,420
After the ruling was made,

845
00:36:00,600 --> 00:36:01,930
all of us

846
00:36:01,960 --> 00:36:03,440
got completely drunk.

847
00:36:04,520 --> 00:36:05,630
You know better than anyone

848
00:36:05,630 --> 00:36:07,550
about the huge effort we put into it.

849
00:36:07,550 --> 00:36:09,000
You used to always tell me

850
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:10,920
that once a person

851
00:36:11,030 --> 00:36:12,150
is a police officer for a day,

852
00:36:12,150 --> 00:36:13,400
he or she will remain one forever.

853
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:14,030
So, Mentor,

854
00:36:14,030 --> 00:36:15,190
you are not alone.

855
00:36:15,840 --> 00:36:16,510
You are still

856
00:36:16,510 --> 00:36:18,030
one of us.

857
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:20,130
You can't side with outsiders.

858
00:36:21,630 --> 00:36:22,890
You just can't do that.

859
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:29,280
Come this way.

860
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,200
Wait a moment.

861
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:38,410
Mr. Zhou.

862
00:36:39,510 --> 00:36:40,070
Mr. Zhou!

863
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,490
There are visitors.

864
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:45,030
For civil lawsuits, criminal cases,

865
00:36:45,030 --> 00:36:46,560
inheritance, or divorces?

866
00:36:46,590 --> 00:36:46,920
No.

867
00:36:47,190 --> 00:36:48,920
They're prosecution officers,

868
00:36:48,920 --> 00:36:51,050
saying that they're here for a matter.

869
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:54,930
Let them in then.

870
00:36:55,480 --> 00:36:56,670
Quick, let them in.

871
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,230
Hello.

872
00:36:58,840 --> 00:36:59,640
There you are.

873
00:37:00,070 --> 00:37:00,730
Go make tea.

874
00:37:01,110 --> 00:37:01,770
Have a seat.

875
00:37:04,270 --> 00:37:05,310
T-That's lovely.

876
00:37:07,190 --> 00:37:08,520
The cat knocked it over.

877
00:37:12,870 --> 00:37:13,630
Here, tea for you.

878
00:37:13,630 --> 00:37:14,300
-Thanks.
-Thank you.

879
00:37:14,300 --> 00:37:15,000
Have some tea.

880
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:15,630
I'll leave you to talk.

881
00:37:15,630 --> 00:37:16,070
Okay.

882
00:37:23,550 --> 00:37:24,480
High blood sugar

883
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,520
makes me sleepy all the time.

884
00:37:26,710 --> 00:37:28,550
Where are you...

885
00:37:33,510 --> 00:37:35,360
I'm from Nanlu Procuratorate.

886
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:37,960
She's from Linshan Procuratorate.

887
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:40,530
You're here for Yan Jicai?

888
00:37:42,550 --> 00:37:44,080
What a good memory you have.

889
00:37:45,590 --> 00:37:46,590
I heard he had been

890
00:37:47,070 --> 00:37:48,840
transferred to Bieshan Prison.

891
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:50,170
Disobedient, isn't he?

892
00:37:50,940 --> 00:37:52,450
This guy, I'm telling you,

893
00:37:52,590 --> 00:37:54,230
is utterly stubborn, and needs

894
00:37:54,230 --> 00:37:55,230
to be taught a lesson.

895
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:55,960
You were

896
00:37:56,110 --> 00:37:57,480
his defense lawyer years ago, right?

897
00:37:57,480 --> 00:37:59,340
Yes, I was appointed by the court.

898
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,030
Mr. Zhou,

899
00:38:00,510 --> 00:38:02,310
you were on the case for the entire time.

900
00:38:02,310 --> 00:38:03,120
Do you notice

901
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,580
anything odd about it?

902
00:38:06,370 --> 00:38:08,450
Just tell me straight

903
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:10,080
what you want to hear from me.

904
00:38:10,560 --> 00:38:11,930
Anyway, my opinions

905
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:14,190
are all written in the defense statement.

906
00:38:14,190 --> 00:38:14,960
You've read that,

907
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:15,880
haven't you?

908
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:17,280
Yes.

909
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:18,570
It's well written.

910
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,110
Of course it is.

911
00:38:20,680 --> 00:38:21,450
Judging from

912
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:22,530
the first half of it,

913
00:38:22,530 --> 00:38:23,960
it seems that you think he's innocent.

914
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,800
But the second half is an arguement

915
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,510
for a lighter sentence, saying that it was

916
00:38:27,510 --> 00:38:29,220
Yan's first offense of a casual nature.

917
00:38:29,220 --> 00:38:29,950
In addition,

918
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:32,110
you agree with the indictment

919
00:38:32,470 --> 00:38:34,010
that the facts are basically clear

920
00:38:34,010 --> 00:38:35,670
and the evidence conclusive.

921
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:36,700
Don't you think

922
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,920
these two parts are contradictory?

923
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:40,630
Are they?

924
00:38:40,710 --> 00:38:41,440
Aren't they?

925
00:38:42,510 --> 00:38:43,360
Yes, they are.

926
00:38:43,690 --> 00:38:44,280
But the world

927
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:45,510
is made up of all sorts

928
00:38:45,530 --> 00:38:46,660
of contradictions.

929
00:38:47,030 --> 00:38:49,290
Are there any conflicts between you two?

930
00:38:49,630 --> 00:38:50,510
N-No.

931
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,400
Maybe not now,

932
00:38:51,420 --> 00:38:53,020
but there will be, probably.

933
00:38:54,120 --> 00:38:55,230
How long have you two

934
00:38:55,230 --> 00:38:56,290
been prosecutors?

935
00:38:56,600 --> 00:38:58,190
You're not very young, are you?

936
00:38:58,190 --> 00:38:59,920
You can't be that naive, right?

937
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:03,920
Though you were a court-appointed lawyer,

938
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:04,470
you had to be

939
00:39:04,470 --> 00:39:06,530
responsible for your client, right?

940
00:39:07,410 --> 00:39:08,770
That's a wrong way

941
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:09,550
to put it.

942
00:39:10,290 --> 00:39:11,950
The task I initially received

943
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:14,010
was to plead for a lighter sentence
for Yan.

944
00:39:14,010 --> 00:39:15,000
Because only in that way

945
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:16,680
could he stand a chance of living.

946
00:39:16,680 --> 00:39:18,190
He got suspended death penalty
in the end.

947
00:39:18,190 --> 00:39:19,070
That was good, wasn't it?

948
00:39:19,070 --> 00:39:20,670
However, if I had gone against

949
00:39:20,670 --> 00:39:22,450
the prosecution from the start

950
00:39:22,470 --> 00:39:24,390
and pleaded not guilty for him,

951
00:39:24,420 --> 00:39:25,400
he would very likely

952
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:26,840
have ended up with

953
00:39:27,190 --> 00:39:28,590
an immediate execution.

954
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:31,400
As you said,

955
00:39:32,160 --> 00:39:33,670
Yan Jicai rejected the lawyer

956
00:39:33,670 --> 00:39:34,760
his wife got him

957
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:36,220
because he trusted you

958
00:39:36,390 --> 00:39:37,870
and bet his whole life

959
00:39:37,890 --> 00:39:39,010
on you.

960
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:40,340
But what happened?

961
00:39:41,030 --> 00:39:41,550
Are you

962
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,960
setting up

963
00:39:42,980 --> 00:39:44,110
a temporary moral court

964
00:39:44,110 --> 00:39:45,920
in my office to judge me?

965
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:47,150
No, no. She's not.

966
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:47,900
Mr. Zhou,

967
00:39:47,900 --> 00:39:49,480
this is definitely not what we mean.

968
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,760
Look, as you said just now,

969
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:52,030
you wanted to save Yan Jicai's life.

970
00:39:52,030 --> 00:39:53,150
That's our aim too.

971
00:39:53,250 --> 00:39:53,630
You see,

972
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:54,690
we're gathered here

973
00:39:54,690 --> 00:39:55,690
for the same goal.

974
00:39:56,590 --> 00:39:58,450
Now that's the right way to put it.

975
00:39:59,110 --> 00:39:59,910
I defended him

976
00:40:00,040 --> 00:40:00,670
simply based

977
00:40:00,670 --> 00:40:02,550
on the content of the indictment.

978
00:40:03,080 --> 00:40:03,840
As for my doubts,

979
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:04,920
I wrote them all

980
00:40:04,940 --> 00:40:06,400
in the defense statement.

981
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:08,110
But the court didn't accept them.

982
00:40:08,110 --> 00:40:09,720
So I chose to give up.

983
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:10,940
Why did you give up?

984
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:12,440
Because I had to live.

985
00:40:12,880 --> 00:40:13,710
What's your surname?

986
00:40:13,710 --> 00:40:14,150
Zhang.

987
00:40:14,360 --> 00:40:15,420
Prosecutor Zhang,

988
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:17,120
let's suppose

989
00:40:19,110 --> 00:40:21,630
I had carried out an investigation
and collected evidence,

990
00:40:21,630 --> 00:40:23,030
and that the testimonies I got

991
00:40:23,030 --> 00:40:24,590
were inconsistent with those obtained

992
00:40:24,590 --> 00:40:25,340
by the police,

993
00:40:25,340 --> 00:40:25,960
which

994
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:27,540
do you say the court

995
00:40:27,550 --> 00:40:28,480
would opt for?

996
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:31,560
If facts are presented in court,

997
00:40:31,600 --> 00:40:32,190
I don't believe

998
00:40:32,190 --> 00:40:33,360
any judge would

999
00:40:33,600 --> 00:40:34,770
disregard them

1000
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:36,130
and make a wrong ruling.

1001
00:40:36,230 --> 00:40:37,560
You don't believe that?

1002
00:40:37,980 --> 00:40:39,290
Why don't you ask me

1003
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:40,320
if I believe that?

1004
00:40:42,450 --> 00:40:44,360
What if they had said
I coerced the witnesses

1005
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:46,110
into changing their testimonies?

1006
00:40:46,110 --> 00:40:48,730
What if I had been convicted
of witness tampering?

1007
00:40:48,730 --> 00:40:50,410
Those witnesses were all unreliable.

1008
00:40:50,410 --> 00:40:51,440
They could retract

1009
00:40:51,440 --> 00:40:53,640
their previous statements at any time.

1010
00:40:54,360 --> 00:40:55,840
I've tried cases long enough

1011
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:57,560
to see plenty of those people.

1012
00:40:57,710 --> 00:41:00,080
Haven't I made enough mistakes
to learn better?

1013
00:41:00,080 --> 00:41:00,880
So you just chose to

1014
00:41:00,880 --> 00:41:01,730
sacrifice your own client?

1015
00:41:01,730 --> 00:41:02,730
I sacrificed him?

1016
00:41:04,190 --> 00:41:05,400
You think I did that?

1017
00:41:05,550 --> 00:41:06,330
Do you dare say

1018
00:41:06,330 --> 00:41:07,150
the same thing to the court

1019
00:41:07,150 --> 00:41:08,480
and the procuratorate?

1020
00:41:09,590 --> 00:41:10,510
We are no...

1021
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:19,620
Got beaten again, didn't you?

1022
00:41:22,630 --> 00:41:23,560
No, they missed.

1023
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:25,450
Thank God I ran fast enough.

1024
00:41:26,710 --> 00:41:28,040
But the truth is out now.

1025
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:29,230
That braised meat shop

1026
00:41:29,230 --> 00:41:30,890
must be selling tainted pork.

1027
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:33,710
She's no outsider. This is my daughter—

1028
00:41:33,710 --> 00:41:34,440
a reporter.

1029
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:36,160
What a noble profession.

1030
00:41:36,190 --> 00:41:36,710
Hello.

1031
00:41:37,370 --> 00:41:37,770
Hello.

1032
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:38,960
No one in our family

1033
00:41:38,980 --> 00:41:40,020
does proper work.

1034
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:42,110
Don't sell yourself short,

1035
00:41:42,110 --> 00:41:42,670
Zhou.

1036
00:41:43,360 --> 00:41:44,220
You've handled

1037
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:46,210
a few miscarriages of justice.

1038
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:47,330
When you are old,

1039
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,930
I'll write memoirs for you.

1040
00:41:51,070 --> 00:41:52,130
The two of you don't

1041
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:54,440
look like some defendant's family.

1042
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,260
Are you the plaintiff?

1043
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:58,100
We are prosecution officers.

1044
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:05,620
[Liangcheng Law Firm]

1045
00:42:16,370 --> 00:42:17,170
Why is Mr. Zhou

1046
00:42:17,190 --> 00:42:18,400
being so resistant?

1047
00:42:19,510 --> 00:42:22,310
Every sentence he said
was a rhetorical question.

1048
00:42:23,150 --> 00:42:24,750
Lihui, haven't you noticed?

1049
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:26,240
Noticed what?

1050
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:28,060
Never mind.

1051
00:42:29,710 --> 00:42:30,360
What is it?

1052
00:42:31,190 --> 00:42:32,790
Did I... say anything wrong?

1053
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:37,730
In fact, you asked no fewer questions
than he did.

1054
00:42:38,570 --> 00:42:39,760
Sometimes when you talk to me,

1055
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:41,170
or even when you express your feelings,

1056
00:42:41,170 --> 00:42:42,370
you do the same thing.

1057
00:42:43,230 --> 00:42:44,800
Is it because you got used to
talking to prisoners

1058
00:42:44,800 --> 00:42:47,030
that way when you were
a resident prosecutor?

1059
00:42:47,030 --> 00:42:48,690
It has nothing to do with that.

1060
00:42:49,590 --> 00:42:50,720
Please don't be mad.

1061
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:52,110
I'm not mad.

1062
00:42:52,590 --> 00:42:53,800
I think you're right.

1063
00:42:54,320 --> 00:42:56,030
I do have a problem in this regard.

1064
00:42:56,030 --> 00:42:56,890
I'll work on it.

1065
00:42:59,030 --> 00:42:59,670
It's okay.

1066
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:00,990
Let's talk to Qiao Xiaojun again.

1067
00:43:00,990 --> 00:43:02,240
He definitely hasn't told us everything.
